  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-17T21:15:08.844Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the release of Chatbox 2.0 in Open Beta, I wanted to provide some feedback on the chatbox itself, specifically the box used to display messages. I think it would be a neat touch to have an option to display the username in the top-left corner of the chatbox. This feature would be especially useful for players who have nameplates turned off, making it easier to identify which chatbox belongs to whom, particularly in crowded instances. Additionally, it would add a bit of an RPG flair, in my opinion. Another suggestion would be to include an arrow or protrusion extending from the chatbox toward its respective user.",
